,{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Returning ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization\/PINReply\/cancel","isActive":true},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"code":"providePIN","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" aborts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the ceremony with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError\/cancelled(source:)","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a high-level passkey client that runs WebAuthn ceremonies against a YubiKey."}]},{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is the entry point for WebAuthn in this SDK. It wraps a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientDataJSON"},{"type":"text","text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/do